@page "/not-found"
@layout MainLayout

@* Reached via UseStatusCodePagesWithReExecute ("/not-found") and the Router's NotFoundPage. It carries
   an h1 so <FocusOnNavigate Selector="h1" /> in Routes.razor finds a target and screen readers get a
   page heading (issue #126). *@

<PageTitle>Page not found</PageTitle>

<h1>Page not found</h1>

<p class="text-muted">
    The requested address does not belong to any page of this interface.
</p>

<p>
    <a href="">Back to the overview</a>
</p>
